{"id":"n74104-7-5","stage":1,"title":"듣다 · 见效","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74104-7-5-1","ko":"그렇게 허리가 아프면 진통제를 먹어.","zh":"如果腰痛得那么厉害，就吃止痛药吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"허리가","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리가","audio":"/audio/ce5c6c7b6a73dfaf9320.mp3"}},{"text":"아프면","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프면","audio":"/audio/72d5d8bb3fb52894a729.mp3"}},{"text":"진통제를","meaning":"镇痛剂，止痛药","explanation":"진통제：镇痛剂，止痛药；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"진통제","audio":"/audio/751d4a00910007a2c9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76155","senseId":"1","lemma":"진통제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진통제를","audio":"/audio/7056b015dc379e6fb628.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어","audio":"/audio/65922367ccfa237c5c51.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"751d4a00910007a2","term":"진통제","zh":"镇痛剂，止痛药","audio":"/audio/751d4a00910007a2c9b3.mp3","entryId":"76155","definition":"缓解疼痛的药物。","pronunciation":["진ː통제"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bd0bde0b1f399cb47e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74104-7-5-2","ko":"나는 진통제가 잘 안 들어서 소용없어.","zh":"我吃止痛药效果不太好，所以没用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"진통제가","meaning":"镇痛剂，止痛药","explanation":"진통제：镇痛剂，止痛药；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"진통제","audio":"/audio/751d4a00910007a2c9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76155","senseId":"1","lemma":"진통제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진통제가","audio":"/audio/6a7f0d4c836de320ef6f.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，有效地","explanation":"잘：很好地，有效地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"13","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"들어서","meaning":"见效，有效","explanation":"듣다：见效，有效；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"7","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어서","audio":"/audio/1958524b05c63f4d1762.mp3"}},{"text":"소용없어.","meaning":"没有意义，没有用","explanation":"소용없다：没有意义，没有用；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"소용없다","audio":"/audio/4fbc1c52e9f4d9198a03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49245","senseId":"1","lemma":"소용없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소용없어","audio":"/audio/6123e455b8833f34d2e6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"751d4a00910007a2","term":"진통제","zh":"镇痛剂，止痛药","audio":"/audio/751d4a00910007a2c9b3.mp3","entryId":"76155","definition":"缓解疼痛的药物。","pronunciation":["진ː통제"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，有效地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"功能或效果让人满意地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"见效，有效","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"药物等起作用。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"4fbc1c52e9f4d919","term":"소용없다","zh":"没有意义，没有用","audio":"/audio/4fbc1c52e9f4d9198a03.mp3","entryId":"49245","definition":"没有任何利益或用处。","pronunciation":["소ː용업따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c05ea488680845ea578.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74104","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSense